{"id":"torrey:death-of-christ-the","source":"torrey","name":"Death Of Christ, The","slug":"death-of-christ-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Foretold — Isa 53:8; Da 9:26; Zec 13:7.","refs":[["Isa",53,8,53,8],["Dan",9,26,9,26],["Zech",13,7,13,7]]},{"text":"Appointed by God — Isa 53:6,10; Ac 2:23.","refs":[["Isa",53,6,53,6],["Isa",53,10,53,10],["Acts",2,23,2,23]]},{"text":"Necessary for the redemption of man — Lu 24:46; Ac 17:3.","refs":[["Luke",24,46,24,46],["Acts",17,3,17,3]]},{"text":"Acceptable, as a sacrifice to God — Mt 20:28; Eph 5:2; 1Th 5:10.","refs":[["Matt",20,28,20,28],["Eph",5,2,5,2],["1Thess",5,10,5,10]]},{"text":"Was voluntary — Isa 53:12; Mt 26:53; Joh 10:17,18.","refs":[["Isa",53,12,53,12],["Matt",26,53,26,53],["John",10,17,10,17],["John",10,18,10,18]]},{"text":"Was undeserved — Isa 53:9.","refs":[["Isa",53,9,53,9]]},{"text":"Foretold by Christ. — Mt 20:18,19; Joh 12:32,33.","refs":[["Matt",20,18,20,18],["Matt",20,19,20,19],["John",12,32,12,32],["John",12,33,12,33]]},{"text":"Prefigured. — Nu 21:8; Joh 3:14.","refs":[["Num",21,8,21,8],["John",3,14,3,14]]},{"text":"Ignominious. — Heb 12:2.","refs":[["Heb",12,2,12,2]]},{"text":"Accursed. — Ga 3:13.","refs":[["Gal",3,13,3,13]]},{"text":"Exhibited His humility. — Php 2:8.","refs":[["Phil",2,8,2,8]]},{"text":"A stumbling block to Jews. — 1Co 1:23.","refs":[["1Cor",1,23,1,23]]},{"text":"Foolishness to Gentiles. — 1Co 1:18,23.","refs":[["1Cor",1,18,1,18],["1Cor",1,23,1,23]]},{"text":"Demanded by the Jews — Mt 27:22,23.","refs":[["Matt",27,22,27,22],["Matt",27,23,27,23]]},{"text":"Inflicted by the Gentiles — Mt 27:26-35.","refs":[["Matt",27,26,27,35]]},{"text":"In the company of malefactors — Isa 53:12; Mt 27:38.","refs":[["Isa",53,12,53,12],["Matt",27,38,27,38]]},{"text":"Accompanied by supernatural signs — Mt 27:45,51-53.","refs":[["Matt",27,45,27,45],["Matt",27,51,27,53]]},{"text":"Emblematical of the death to sin — Ro 6:3-8; Ga 2:20.","refs":[["Rom",6,3,6,8],["Gal",2,20,2,20]]},{"text":"Commemorated in the ordinance of the Lord’s supper — Lu 22:19,20; 1Co 11:26-29.","refs":[["Luke",22,19,22,19],["Luke",22,20,22,20],["1Cor",11,26,11,29]]}],"refCount":40}
